#==============================================================================================
#
#   document_state - HTML::DocumentState and HTML::SessionHistoryEntry: the document state of a
#   session history entry, and the entry
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HTML/DocumentState.cpp (lines 1-17) with DocumentState.h's
#       inline accessors, and of SessionHistoryEntry.cpp (lines 1-33) with SessionHistoryEntry.h's
#       inline accessors. Both are RefCounted in C++: managed memory here (DESIGN.md §3.3).
